<h1>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Busy @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Usage</h1>

<p>
    Practical examples showing the Busy indicator component configured with various parameters.
</p>

<p>The following example shows a typical usage with parameters being set at both design and runtime:</p>

<CodeBox CodeBlock="@BusySnippets.Busy_Indicator_Example" AriaLabel="Busy indicator example code block" />
<p>
    <strong>Note: </strong>Please keep your announcements short and too the point and only provide starting text for processes that that may take longer than four or five seconds.
</p>
<p>
    For sections of code that are being covered by the inert overlay of the busy indicator sometimes it makes it clearer by wrapping the content.
    You can also do this:
</p>
